<quiz>
  <question type="stack">
    <name>
      <text>The Ferris wheel (angle at the centre is twice the angle at the circumference)</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>A Ferris wheel has its centre at \(O\). Cabins \(A\), \(B\) and \(C\) hang from the rim, and the spokes \(OA\) and \(OB\) join the centre to cabins \(A\) and \(B\).
A rider in cabin \(C\) looks at cabins \(A\) and \(B\): the angle between the two lines of sight is \(ACB = {@c@}^\circ\).</p>

<div style="text-align:center;" role="img" aria-label="A Ferris wheel with centre O on a stand. Cabins A and B are near the top and cabin C near the bottom. Spokes OA and OB form angle AOB; lines of sight CA and CB form an angle of {#c#} degrees at C.">
[[jsxgraph width="380px" height="400px"]]
var board = JXG.JSXGraph.initBoard(divid, {boundingbox:[-1.6,1.6,1.6,-1.8], axis:false, showCopyright:false, showNavigation:false, keepAspectRatio:true});
var r = Math.PI/180;
var c = {#c#}, cc = {#cc#};
function pt(nm, deg, col) {
  var t = deg*r;
  return board.create('point',[Math.cos(t),Math.sin(t)],{name:nm,fixed:true,size:5,strokeColor:col,fillColor:col,
    label:{offset:[16*Math.cos(t)-4,16*Math.sin(t)-4],strokeColor:col}});
}
// ground and stand
board.create('segment',[[-1.4,-1.6],[1.4,-1.6]],{fixed:true,strokeColor:'#16a34a',strokeWidth:8,highlight:false});
board.create('segment',[[-0.7,-1.6],[0,0]],{fixed:true,strokeColor:'#92400e',strokeWidth:5,highlight:false});
board.create('segment',[[0.7,-1.6],[0,0]],{fixed:true,strokeColor:'#92400e',strokeWidth:5,highlight:false});
// wheel
board.create('circle',[[0,0],1],{fixed:true,strokeColor:'#1d4ed8',strokeWidth:4,fillColor:'#bfdbfe',fillOpacity:0.5,highlight:false});
var O = board.create('point',[0,0],{name:'O',fixed:true,size:4,strokeColor:'#1e293b',fillColor:'#1e293b',label:{offset:[8,-16]}});
var A = pt('A', 90+c, '#dc2626');
var B = pt('B', 90-c, '#dc2626');
var C = pt('C', cc, '#16a34a');
board.create('segment',[O,A],{fixed:true,strokeColor:'#dc2626',strokeWidth:3});
board.create('segment',[O,B],{fixed:true,strokeColor:'#dc2626',strokeWidth:3});
board.create('segment',[C,A],{fixed:true,strokeColor:'#ea580c',strokeWidth:3});
board.create('segment',[C,B],{fixed:true,strokeColor:'#ea580c',strokeWidth:3});
board.create('segment',[A,B],{fixed:true,strokeColor:'#7c3aed',strokeWidth:2,dash:2});
board.create('angle',[B,C,A],{radius:0.3,fillColor:'#facc15',fillOpacity:0.8,strokeColor:'#ca8a04',withLabel:false});
board.create('angle',[B,O,A],{radius:0.3,fillColor:'#fca5a5',fillOpacity:0.8,strokeColor:'#dc2626',withLabel:false});
function angLabel(brd, A, V, C, t) { var ax = A.X() - V.X(), ay = A.Y() - V.Y(), cx = C.X() - V.X(), cy = C.Y() - V.Y(); var la = Math.sqrt(ax*ax + ay*ay), lc = Math.sqrt(cx*cx + cy*cy); var ux = ax/la + cx/lc, uy = ay/la + cy/lc, lu = Math.sqrt(ux*ux + uy*uy); var h = Math.acos(Math.max(-1, Math.min(1, (ax*cx + ay*cy)/(la*lc))))/2; var d = Math.min(0.72, Math.max(0.44, 0.15/Math.tan(h))); brd.create('text', [V.X() + d*ux/lu, V.Y() + d*uy/lu, t], {anchorX:'middle', anchorY:'middle', fontSize:13, fixed:true, highlight:false, cssStyle:'background:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);padding:0 2px;border-radius:3px'}); }
angLabel(board, B, C, A, '{#c#}°');
[[/jsxgraph]]
</div>

<p>(a) Find angle \(AOB\). [[input:ans1]]\(^\circ\) [[validation:ans1]]</p>
<div>[[feedback:prt1]]</div>

<p>(b) Find angle \(OAB\). [[input:ans2]]\(^\circ\) [[validation:ans2]]</p>
<div>[[feedback:prt2]]</div>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<h4>Worked solution</h4>
<p><strong>(a)</strong> The angle at the centre is twice the angle at the circumference when both stand on the same arc:
\(AOB = 2 \times {@c@} = {@ta1@}^\circ\).</p>
<p><strong>(b)</strong> \(OA = OB\) because they are radii, so triangle \(OAB\) is isosceles with equal base angles:
\(OAB = (180 - {@ta1@}) \div 2 = {@ta2@}^\circ\).</p>]]></text>
    </generalfeedback>
